{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21693","headline":"和乐天寻郭道士不遇 · 元稹","name":"和乐天寻郭道士不遇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔年我见杯中渡，今日人言鹤上逢。\n两虎定随千岁鹿，双林添作几株松。\n方瞳应是新烧药，短脚知缘旧施舂。\n欲请僧繇远相画，苦愁频变本形容。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21693.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21693","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}